    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the tea and the walks... it feels like trying to build a house on quicksand. it doesn't matter how many little things i do, the gravity just isn't there anymore. i look around and nothing feels real. it's like i'm already gone, just waiting for my body to catch up to the fact that i don't belong anywhere. it's almost peaceful, thinking about just letting go of the struggle and letting the current take me.",
